---
---

<section class="section" id="pricing">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="section-label">Hosted option</p>
    <h2 class="section-heading">Cloud if you want it.<br />Free if you self-host.</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">
      Self-hosting is always free. The hosted version has two tiers — start free, upgrade when you need unlimited sends.
    </p>

    <div class="pricing-grid">

      <div class="pricing-card featured">
        <div class="pricing-badge-top">Self-hosted · Recommended</div>
        <h3>Self-host</h3>
        <p class="pricing-desc">Clone the repo, deploy to AWS, done. No account needed.</p>
        <ul class="pricing-features">
          <li>Unlimited everything</li>
          <li>Full data ownership</li>
          <li>CLI + REST API + extension + web app</li>
          <li>ELv2 — audit &amp; fork freely</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="https://github.com/savetoink/savetoink#self-hosting" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-primary" style="width:100%;justify-content:center;">
          Read the docs →
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="pricing-card">
        <h3>Free</h3>
        <div class="pricing-price">$0</div>
        <p class="pricing-desc">Forever free, no credit card.</p>
        <ul class="pricing-features">
          <li class="highlight">Unlimited use for now</li>
          <li>20 article sends / month</li>
          <li>Kindle &amp; Kobo delivery</li>
          <li>Browser extension</li>
          <li>Article library</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="https://app.saveto.ink/" class="btn-secondary" style="width:100%;justify-content:center;">
          Get started free
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="pricing-card coming-soon">
        <div class="coming-soon-ribbon" aria-label="Coming soon"></div>
        <h3>Pro</h3>
        <div class="pricing-price">$4 <span>/ month</span></div>
        <p class="pricing-desc">Or $24/year — save 50%.</p>
        <ul class="pricing-features">
          <li>Unlimited sends</li>
          <li>Everything in Free</li>
          <li>Early access to features</li>
        </ul>
        <button disabled style="width:100%;justify-content:center;opacity:0.45;cursor:not-allowed;">
          Not available yet
        </button>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .pricing-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  .pricing-card {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink) 4%, var(--paper));
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--card-radius);
    padding: 2rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .pricing-card.featured {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 5%, var(--paper));
  }

  .pricing-badge-top {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .pricing-card h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
  }

  .pricing-price {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 2.4rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--ink);
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
  }

  .pricing-price span {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    color: var(--muted);
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .pricing-desc {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
  }

  .pricing-features {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 1.75rem;
    display: flex !important;
    flex-direction: column !important;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .pricing-features li {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    display: flex !important;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .pricing-features li::before {
    content: '✓';
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 700;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .pricing-features li.highlight {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .pricing-features li.highlight::before {
    content: '✦';
  }

  .pricing-card.coming-soon {
    opacity: 0.6;
    overflow: hidden;
    pointer-events: none;
    user-select: none;
  }

  .coming-soon-ribbon {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    right: 0;
    width: 6rem;
    height: 6rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .coming-soon-ribbon::before {
    content: 'Coming soon';
    position: absolute;
    top: 1.1rem;
    right: -1.85rem;
    width: 7.5rem;
    background: var(--muted);
    color: var(--paper);
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.07em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 0.28rem 0;
    transform: rotate(45deg);
    transform-origin: center center;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .pricing-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
